<span id="S1.T1.5.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S1.T1.5.1.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Detection Method</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S1.T1.5.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="S1.T1.5.1.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:122.3pt;--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">
<span id="S1.T1.5.1.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Compare with pre-defined watermarks with error tolerance</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S1.T1.5.1.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="S1.T1.5.1.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:122.3pt;--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">
<span id="S1.T1.5.1.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Check integrity via exact match with ground truth</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S1.T1.5.1.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle">
<span id="S1.T1.5.1.3.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:130.9pt;--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">
<span id="S1.T1.5.1.3.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">Extract proof then apply cryptographic verification</span>
</span></td></tr>
